---
/**
 * Clients page: “What Our Clients Have Sought Us For” section.
 * Hidden on desktop.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-d66bfd5 vb-hidden-desktop e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="d66bfd5"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-598cf40 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
      data-id="598cf40"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="heading.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <h1 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">What Our Clients Have Sought Us For</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-89ac8e1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="89ac8e1"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-d9bbbd6 vb-pagination-position-outside vb-widget vb-widget-image-carousel"
        data-id="d9bbbd6"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-settings={'{"slides_to_show":"1","navigation":"dots","autoplay_speed":2000,"lazyload":"yes","autoplay":"yes","pause_on_hover":"yes","pause_on_interaction":"yes","effect":"slide","speed":500}'}
        data-widget_type="image-carousel.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div
            class="vb-image-carousel-wrapper swiper"
            role="region"
            aria-roledescription="carousel"
            aria-label="Image Carousel"
            dir="ltr"
          >
            <div class="vb-image-carousel swiper-wrapper" aria-live="off">
              <div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.50-1-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Corporate Trainer Presenting to Participants | Mathew Isac| VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.51-1-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Interactive Business Session in Lecture Hall | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.51-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Mathew Isac - Team Coachign session | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="4 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.50-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Group Photo of Professionals After Workshop | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="5 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.53-2-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Professional Team Gathering | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="6 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.54-1066x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Smiling Team Together | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="7 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.49-1-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Outdoor Team Photo | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div><div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="8 of 8">
                <figure class="swiper-slide-inner">
                  <img
                    loading="lazy"
                    src="/assets/uploads/2025/07/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-09-at-19.36.48-1-1063x800.jpeg"
                    class="swiper-slide-image"
                    alt="Creative Team Activity | VentureBean"
                  />
                </figure>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-ecb0688 vb-widget__width-initial our-client vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="ecb0688"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <ul>
            <li style="text-align: left;">
              <h5>Business growth consulting across industries and growth stages</h5>
            </li><li><h5>Executive coaching for leaders, professionals, teams, and organisations</h5></li><li>
              <h5>Business or functional growth advisory with measurable impact</h5>
            </li><li><h5>Founder mindset coaching for clarity, resilience, and bold decision-making</h5></li><li>
              <h5>Performance advisory for SMBs to sharpen systems, strategy, and leadership</h5>
            </li><li><h5>Startup coaching that strengthens mindset, execution, and scale</h5></li><li>
              <h5>Leadership alignment workshops to unite executive teams around shared purpose</h5>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-2f65309 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="2f65309"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-335b0ec vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="335b0ec"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <h5>
            <em
              >These aren’t just services, they’re trust based partnerships built on shared vision, challenge, and
              change. Behind every logo is a team that showed up with openness, courage, and a desire to move forward
              with clarity.</em>
          </h5>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
